        "### Markov Switching Model Calibration\n",
        "\n",
        "We fit a model with two states to identify shifts in the mean and variance of AAPL returns. The model provides:\n",
        "1.  **Regime Parameters**: Mean (intercept) and Variance for each state.\n",
        "2.  **Transition Matrix**: The probability of staying in or switching between states.\n",
        "3.  **Expected Duration**: How long the market typically stays in each regime."
      ]
    },
